{{!--
Arrival animation of the home page (setting « Arrival animation », arrival_animation, with the coloured
GEEKly wordmark, use_geekly_logo): on a dark screen the letters G E E K are painted with a brush
stroke, "ly" is written like a pen, then the wordmark travels to its place in the hero while the page
appears (1.95 s in all, see src/css/home/intro.css for the timing).

The layer is decoration only (aria-hidden) and is shown only while <html> carries data-intro="play",
which the script in default.hbs sets before the first paint: once per browser session
(sessionStorage "attibling-intro"), on the first page of the home only, never with
prefers-reduced-motion. Any click, key, wheel, touch or scroll ends it at once. Without that attribute
(no script, crawlers, reduced motion, already seen) the layer is display: none and the page shows as
usual: its content is in the HTML under it the whole time.

The letters are the outlines of Onest 800 (G E E K) and of the theme's Pacifico ("l", and "y" in
its final form, as the browser shapes "ly") in font units (1000 per em,
baseline at y = 0); each is revealed by a mask: a thick stroke following the letter
(stroke-dashoffset). home.js (src/js/intro.js) measures the hero wordmark and sets --intro-to, the
transform that lands this mark exactly on it; without it the mark simply fades with the screen.
--}}
